<section class="bhd-page__cards-section">
  <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Evidence types</p>
  <h2>Different studies answer different questions</h2>
  <div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--3">
    <article><h3>Review</h3><p>Synthesizes existing literature and identifies mechanisms, gaps and research priorities.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Product study</h3><p>Tests the actual formulation under a defined protocol and is the direct route to product-specific evidence.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Implementation study</h3><p>Tests whether an approach can work acceptably in its intended real-world setting.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

